OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's death case referred up
OL,4,Aafter police probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into the death of
OL,7,Fwoman in a house fire has been referred
OL,8,Fup after a previous police probe.
OL,10,FIzabela Chalastra, 46, died in hospital
OL,11,Fsix days after the blaze in Nottingham
OL,12,Fon 1 March 2024.
OL,14,FThe inquest heard there had been a
OL,15,F"history of domestic abuse" and
OL,16,FZbigniew Lewandowski - who was under a
OL,17,Fprotection order at the time - visited
OL,18,Fthe address but denied entering the
OL,19,Fproperty. He was arrested in connection
OL,20,Fwith the fire, and later detained on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of murder but no charges were
OL,22,Fbrought due to "insufficient evidence".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
